        <activityName xml:lang="en">Process-specific burdens, sanitary landfill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Process-specific burdens, sanitary landfill
landfill for untreated municipal solid waste;
Synonyms: municipal landfill; 
UUID: f332a783-d9b1-45a4-9616-50cfbcc4d98c
process-specific (i.e. independent of waste composition) energy demand and land use of landfill
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss municipal landfill for biogenic or untreated municipal waste ("reactive organic landfill"). Landfill gas and leachate collection system. Recultivation and monitoring for 150 years after closure.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from one literature source 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f332a783-d9b1-45a4-9616-50cfbcc4d98c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
